---
import { READING_PILOT_ENABLED } from '../../lib/reading-pilot';
import PrivateLibrary from './PrivateLibrary.astro';
const enabled = READING_PILOT_ENABLED && import.meta.env.PUBLIC_HUB_LIBRARY_PRIVATE !== 'staged-v1';
---
{enabled && <section class="portal-daily" data-reading-pilot data-home-personal aria-labelledby="reading-pilot-heading">
 <header class="portal-section-heading"><div><h2 id="reading-pilot-heading">Pick up your reading</h2><p class="portal-muted">Library connection · optional · read-only</p></div></header>
 <p>See saved book titles and reading progress, then resume the exact edition in Library. By default the result comes from this browser. If you explicitly enable Account-synced sharing in Library and both apps verify the same THIEPN Account, Library may reconcile this device first.</p>
 <p class="portal-muted">Hub receives only bounded title/progress metadata. It never receives book files, exact reader anchors, highlights, notes, annotations, shelves, tags, or Library’s raw cloud snapshot. Phone and tablet behavior remains subject to the physical-device acceptance campaign.</p>
 <ol class="portal-reading-steps" aria-label="Reading setup">
  <li><strong>Join this tab</strong><span>Nothing loads automatically.</span></li>
  <li><strong>Choose Library sharing</strong><span>Enable summary or Continue; Account-synced reading is a separate opt-in.</span></li>
  <li><strong>Connect and resume</strong><span>Continue opens the matching book edition.</span></li>
 </ol>
 <p class="portal-muted">Opening Library or switching tabs clears the Hub snapshot. When you return, join and connect again for fresh metadata. Library remains the data owner and its sharing choice stays in this browser until you change it.</p>
 <p data-reading-pilot-status role="status" aria-live="polite">Nothing is read until you join and connect. Library’s separate sharing choices still apply.</p>
 <button class="portal-button" type="button" data-reading-pilot-join>Try reading pilot</button>
 <button class="portal-button" type="button" data-reading-pilot-end hidden>End pilot and clear this tab</button>
 <PrivateLibrary pilot />
</section>}
